    },
    {
      "id": "claim_410e962e9a1740fba91b149f94f5e1ea",
      "statement": "_parse_with_schema() is the core validation function used by ToolStrategy to parse tool arguments according to the schema kind (pydantic, dataclass, typeddict, or json_schema). It uses TypeAdapter for runtime validation of Pydantic models, dataclasses, and TypedDicts, returning validated instances; for JSON schemas it returns the raw dict without validation. It raises ValueError on parsing or validation failure.",
