    {
      "id": "claim_2fec08df1d5746ec9eda6c96e5ae5c64",
      "statement": "StructuredOutputValidationError and MultipleStructuredOutputsError are specialized error types for ToolStrategy that indicate tool argument validation failure or multiple unexpected tool calls, respectively. Both inherit from StructuredOutputError and carry the ai_message, enabling integration with agent retry logic when handle_errors is enabled.",
