    {
      "id": "claim_9bc436e5ccaf4a48ba447f946240bdc5",
      "statement": "OutputToolBinding and ProviderStrategyBinding encapsulate schema metadata and parsing logic for runtime use in agent execution. OutputToolBinding creates a LangChain StructuredTool from a schema spec for ToolStrategy binding; ProviderStrategyBinding tracks native provider output schemas and parses AIMessage JSON according to the schema kind.",
